---
// Feature specifications grid for FastChat Room
---

<section class="border-b border-[#262626] bg-[#0a0a0a] py-16 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
		<div class="mb-10 text-left">
			<div class="text-xs text-[#ccff00] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">SYSTEM SPECIFICATIONS</div>
			<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono tracking-tight uppercase">
				Engineered For Instant, Untraceable Communication
			</h2>
			<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 font-mono mt-2 max-w-2xl">
				Launch a <strong>temporary chat room no account</strong> required. FastChat Room eliminates intermediaries, 
				connecting peers directly across WebRTC DataChannels with zero persistent logs.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
			<!-- Feature 1: No Signup Chat -->
			<div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#121212] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#3f3f46] transition-colors">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono mb-4">
						<span>SPEC 01</span>
						<span class="text-[#ccff00]">ANONYMOUS</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono uppercase">Instant No Signup Chat</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
						Zero onboarding friction. No registration forms, email verification, or passwords. Generate a unique room code, 
						share the link, and begin conversing in seconds.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1f1f23] text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono">
					AUTH: NONE // DATABASE: NONE
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 2: Quick File Transfer -->
			<div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#121212] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#3f3f46] transition-colors">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono mb-4">
						<span>SPEC 02</span>
						<span class="text-[#ccff00]">HIGH SPEED</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono uppercase">Quick File Transfer Between Computers</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
						Stream binary files directly from browser to browser. Chunks are dispatched over encrypted WebRTC DataChannels 
						at local wire speed without hitting external storage or server quotas.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1f1f23] text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono">
					THROUGHPUT: DIRECT P2P // CLOUD: BYPASSED
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 3: Ephemeral Chat Lifecycle -->
			<div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#121212] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#3f3f46] transition-colors">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono mb-4">
						<span>SPEC 03</span>
						<span class="text-[#ccff00]">EPHEMERAL</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono uppercase">Temporary Chat Room No Account</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
						Every session runs on an unyielding server-synchronized countdown timer. When the room expires, cryptographic keys 
						are dropped and all in-memory buffers are flushed immediately.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1f1f23] text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono">
					LIFECYCLE: AUTO-TERMINATION // PERSISTENCE: 0%
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
